{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"agent_message","text":"The call verifier does a fresh method lookup using the current concrete receiver. For a copied trait body, that can reinterpret calls originally written against the trait’s own method set, which is the over-verification this fix needs to avoid."}}
